WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.860
A convincing reply is not the same as a
confirmed cause.

2
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:08.780
I built a support triage workflow that
investigates before it drafts.

3
00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:15.090
It checks evidence, grades confidence, and saves
a report with a draft customer reply.

4
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.682
This example uses a synthetic ticket. A support
engineer reviews the result.
